<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Long bicycle kick liukang with meter bar</Major>
    <Description>just a simple macro to do a Showdown and Bicycle kick with meter bar, really useful if you lazy to press all of that button
enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 7 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 15 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 15 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 15 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 15 1
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 15 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 15 1
Delay 1000 ms
KeyDown 51 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 51 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Mortal Kombat X</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>